{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u201cQuiet Dan\u201d</strong> is a provocative novel in the format of a visual novel, blurring the boundaries between ordinariness and existential crisis. The protagonist, Dan, a resident of suburban New York City, loses his job as a janitor and sinks into an abyss of loneliness, inner demons, and social injustice. His actions are contradictory and sometimes violent, making the narrative suspenseful and realistic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543420/extras/ezgif-5236572f03f951.gif?t=1746816450\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Improvisational style:</strong> the entire text of the novel is fully voiced and dictated on the fly, without subsequent edits, which gives the story liveliness and a sense of \u201craw\u201d reality. This creates the effect of a theatrical monologue, where Dan's thoughts and dialogues sound as natural as possible</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Genre mix:</strong> includes elements of psychological thriller, social drama and philosophical nonconformism.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"\u0421\u0415\u0419\u0427\u0410\u0421 \u0422\u0410\u041a\u041e\u0415 \u0412\u0420\u0415\u041c\u042f - \u0418 \u0423\u0411\u041e\u0420\u0429\u0418\u041a\u041e\u0412 \u0423\u0411\u0418\u0420\u0410\u042e\u0422","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3543420/da3ea3cf873b91dfca810085b5bdb6d36620237b.jpg"},{"name":"\u0420\u041e\u041a\u041e\u0412\u0410\u042f \u0416\u0415\u041d\u0429\u0418\u041d\u0410","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3543420/96ea5897f0247550c3bee40833d424e85128f8aa.jpg"},{"name":"\u0422\u0418\u0425\u041e \u0418 \u0421\u0422\u0410\u041d\u0414\u0410\u0420\u0422\u041d\u041e","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3543420/cffb9ea394fe0fd512fa3927d15f3bf107953db5.jpg"